    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "1、求下列函数的拉普拉斯逆变换。",
        "bbox": [
            145,
            115,
            455,
            135
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "课后作业\n解: (1) $f(s)=\\frac{3}{(s+4)/(s+2)}=\\frac{k_{1}}{s+2}+\\frac{k_{2}}{s+4}$",
        "bbox": [
            493,
            87,
            911,
            145
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(1) $\\frac{3}{(s + 4)(s + 2)}$",
        "bbox": [
            145,
            142,
            267,
            174
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(2) $\\frac{3s}{(s + 4)(s + 2)}$",
        "bbox": [
            147,
            178,
            267,
            209
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\nk _ {1} = (s + 2) F (s) \\bigg | _ {s = - 2} = \\frac {3}{s + 4} \\bigg | _ {s = - 2} = \\frac {3}{2}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            550,
            149,
            946,
            201
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(3) $\\frac{1}{(s^2 + 3)^2}$",
        "bbox": [
            147,
            213,
            245,
            247
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(4) $\\frac{e^{-s}}{4s(s^2 + 1)}$",
        "bbox": [
            147,
            250,
            254,
            284
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\nk _ {2} = (s + 4) F (s) / s = - 4 = \\frac {3}{s + 2} / s = - 4 = \\frac {3}{- 2}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            550,
            206,
            954,
            252
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(5) $\\ln \\left( \\frac{s}{s + 9} \\right)$",
        "bbox": [
            145,
            287,
            259,
            317
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(3) $F(s) = \\frac{1}{(s^{2}+3)^{2}}$",
        "bbox": [
            55,
            334,
            223,
            372
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\therefore F (s) = \\frac {\\frac {3}{2}}{s + 2} + \\frac {- \\frac {3}{2}}{s + 4}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            540,
            246,
            774,
            295
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "$\\sin\\sqrt{3}(t+1) \\rightarrow \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{s^{2}+3}$",
        "bbox": [
            66,
            363,
            274,
            410
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\therefore f (t) = \\frac {3}{2} (e ^ {- 2 t} - e ^ {- 4 t}) u (t)\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            537,
            300,
            872,
            342
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "$\\left( {\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{18}\\sin \\sqrt{3}t - \\frac{t}{6}\\cos \\sqrt{3}t}\\right)_{\\mathrm{{uni}}}(2)\\;F\\left( s\\right)  = \\frac{3S}{\\left( {S + 4}\\right) \\left( {S + 2}\\right) } = \\frac{{k}_{1}}{S + 4} + \\frac{{k}_{2}}{S + 2}$",
        "bbox": [
            334,
            341,
            910,
            404
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "$\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}} + \\sin \\sqrt{5} + u(t) \\rightarrow  \\frac{2S}{\\left( {{S}^{2} + 3}\\right) ^{2}}$",
        "bbox": [
            29,
            406,
            299,
            443
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "$\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{3}}t\\sin\\sqrt{3}t(u(t))\\rightarrow\\frac{s}{(s^{2}+3)^{2}}$",
        "bbox": [
            24,
            440,
            272,
            476
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\frac {1}{2 \\sqrt {3}} \\int_ {0} ^ {t} \\tau \\sin \\sqrt {3} \\tau d \\tau\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            334,
            435,
            501,
            477
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\nk _ {1} = (S + 4) F (S) / S = - 4 = \\frac {3 S}{8 + 2} / 8 = - 4 = \\frac {- 1 2}{- 2} = 6\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            550,
            395,
            993,
            447
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "∠T积分性质",
        "bbox": [
            24,
            473,
            140,
            502
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\frac {1}{(5 ^ {2} + 3) ^ {2}} \\Leftrightarrow \\int_ {0} ^ {t} \\frac {1}{2 \\sqrt {3}} \\tau \\sin \\sqrt {3} \\tau (u t) d \\tau\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            250,
            489,
            522,
            545
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\nk _ {2} = (s + 2) F (s) / s = - 2 = \\frac {3 s}{s + 4} / s = - 2 = \\frac {- 6}{2} = - 3\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            547,
            446,
            991,
            489
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\therefore F (s) = \\frac {6}{s + 4} + \\frac {- 3}{s + 2}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            537,
            489,
            718,
            532
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n(4) _ {2} ^ {\\lambda} F (s) = \\frac {e ^ {- s}}{4 s (s ^ {2} + 1)}, F _ {1} (s) = \\frac {1}{4 s (s ^ {2} + 1)}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            53,
            554,
            439,
            610
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\nF _ {1} (s) = \\frac {1}{4 s (s ^ {2} + 1)} = \\frac {k _ {0}}{s} + \\frac {k _ {1} s + k _ {2}}{s ^ {2} + 1}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            78,
            618,
            390,
            665
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\nk _ {0} = S F _ {1} (s) / s = 0 = \\frac {1}{4 (s ^ {2} + 1)} / s = 0 = \\frac {1}{4 \\times 1} = \\frac {1}{4}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            60,
            668,
            485,
            720
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\therefore F _ {1} (s) = \\frac {1}{4 s} + \\frac {- s}{4 (s ^ {2} + 1)}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            53,
            790,
            277,
            836
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\frac {k _ {1} s + k _ {2}}{s ^ {2} + 1} = \\frac {1}{4 s (s ^ {2} + 1)} - \\frac {1}{4 s} = \\frac {1 - s ^ {2} - 1}{4 s (s ^ {2} + 1)} = \\frac {- s}{4 (s ^ {2} + 1)}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            49,
            722,
            542,
            778
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\therefore f (t) = \\frac {1}{4} (1 - \\cos t) u (t)\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            55,
            839,
            325,
            878
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\therefore f (t) = f _ {1} (t - 1) = \\frac {1}{4} [ 1 - \\cos (t - 1) ] u (t - 1)\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            55,
            880,
            444,
            922
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\therefore f (t) = (6 e ^ {- 4 t} - 3 e ^ {- x t}) u (t)\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            535,
            532,
            823,
            572
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(5) $F(s) = \\ln \\frac{s}{s+9} = 2n s - 2n (s+9)$ $= \\left[ \\ln \\infty - \\ln (s+9) \\right]$ $- \\left[ \\ln \\infty - \\ln s \\right]$ $= \\int_{s}^{\\infty} \\frac{1}{\\eta + 9} dy - \\int_{s}^{\\infty} \\frac{1}{\\eta} dy$ $= \\frac{e^{-9t}(u(t))}{t} - \\frac{u(t)}{t}$ $= \\frac{1}{t} (e^{-9t} - 1)(u(t))$",
        "bbox": [
            573,
            587,
            978,
            895
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
