    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "2、下列象函数 $F(s)$ 的原函数 $f(t)$ 是t=0接入的有始周期信号，求周期T并写出其第一个周期 $(0<t<T)$ 的时间函数表达式 $f_{0}(t)$ 。",
        "bbox": [
            143,
            84,
            849,
            132
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(1) $\\frac{1}{s(1 + e^{-2s})}$",
        "bbox": [
            145,
            138,
            251,
            169
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(2) $\\frac{\\pi(1 + e^{-s})}{(s^2 + \\pi^2)(1 - e^{-s})}$",
        "bbox": [
            145,
            174,
            287,
            206
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(1) $F\\left( S\\right)  = \\frac{1}{S\\left( {1 + {e}^{-2S}}\\right) }$",
        "bbox": [
            143,
            226,
            383,
            277
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "令 ${F}_{1}\\left( S\\right)  = \\frac{1}{1 + {e}^{-{2s}}} = \\frac{1 - {e}^{-{2s}}}{1 - {e}^{-4s}}$ (2) 令 $F_{0}(s) = \\frac{\\pi}{s^{2} + \\pi^{2}}$ $\\Rightarrow f_{0}(t) = \\sin\\pi t(u(t))$",
        "bbox": [
            156,
            277,
            516,
            341
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "",
        "bbox": [
            710,
            235,
            947,
            323
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "令 ${f}_{2}\\left( S\\right)  = \\frac{1}{1 - e - {4s}} \\Rightarrow  {f}_{2}\\left| t\\right|  = \\mathop{\\sum }\\limits_{{n = 0}}^{\\infty }\\rho \\left| {t - {4n}}\\right|$",
        "bbox": [
            150,
            341,
            650,
            390
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "则 $F_{1}(s)=\\frac{F_{0}(s)}{1-e-s}$ 逆变损得",
        "bbox": [
            699,
            324,
            962,
            376
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\therefore F _ {1} (s) = F _ {2} (s) (1 - e ^ {- x s})\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            155,
            404,
            398,
            436
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\nf _ {1} (t) = f _ {0} (t) * \\frac {\\sum_ {n = 0} ^ {\\infty} \\delta (t - n)}{n}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            679,
            376,
            926,
            421
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\therefore f _ {1} (t) = f _ {2} (t) - f _ {2} (t - 2) = \\frac {\\sum_ {n = 0} ^ {\\infty} [ \\sqrt {(t - 4 n)} - \\sqrt {(t - 2 - 4 n)} ]}{n !} f _ {1} (t) = \\sum_ {n = 0} ^ {\\infty} \\sin \\pi (t - n) u (t - n)\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            155,
            424,
            964,
            483
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\nF _ {0} (s) = \\frac {1}{s} \\Rightarrow f _ {0} (t) = u (t)\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            166,
            490,
            437,
            529
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\because F (s) = F _ {1} (s) (1 + e ^ {- s})\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            702,
            477,
            950,
            513
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\therefore f (t) = \\sum_ {n = 0} ^ {\\infty} [ u (t - 4 n) - u (t - 2 - 4 n) ]\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            155,
            528,
            553,
            574
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\therefore f (t) = f _ {1} (t) + f _ {1} (t - 1)\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            704,
            522,
            944,
            558
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "可见周期为4s. 前一个周期内为 $u(t) - u(t-2)$",
        "bbox": [
            151,
            578,
            599,
            621
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n= \\sum_ {n = 0} ^ {\\infty} \\left[ \\sin \\pi (t - n) u (t - n) \\right] + \\left[ \\sin \\pi (t - 1 - n) u (t - 1 - n) \\right]\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            697,
            559,
            950,
            643
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "可见周娟为15.",
        "bbox": [
            712,
            653,
            890,
            692
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "第一个同期内",
        "bbox": [
            715,
            695,
            857,
            731
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "$\\sin \\pi t [u|t-1 - u(t-1)]$",
        "bbox": [
            743,
            726,
            952,
            769
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
