    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "3、求下列函数的逆变换。",
        "bbox": [
            143,
            84,
            375,
            102
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n(1) X (S) = \\frac {k _ {0}}{S} + \\frac {k _ {1}}{S + 1} + \\frac {k _ {2} S + k _ {3}}{S ^ {2} + 4 S + 8}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            437,
            50,
            748,
            102
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n(1) X (s) = \\frac {2 s ^ {3} + 8 s ^ {2} + 4 s + 8}{s (s + 1) (s ^ {2} + 4 s + 8)}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            145,
            110,
            359,
            145
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n(2) X (s) = \\frac {4}{(s + 1) (s + 2) ^ {3}}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            145,
            149,
            330,
            180
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n(3) X (s) = \\frac {s ^ {2} + 4 s + 2}{(s + 1) (s + 2)}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            145,
            184,
            323,
            217
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(4) $X(s) = \\frac{se^{-2s} + 1}{(s + 1)(s + 2)}$",
        "bbox": [
            145,
            221,
            323,
            255
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "3 (1) 真分式 $x(s)=\\frac{A_{0}}{s}+\\frac{A_{1}}{s+1}+\\frac{A_{2}s+A_{3}}{s^{2}+4s+8}$",
        "bbox": [
            390,
            206,
            694,
            243
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\left\\{ \\begin{array}{l l} {S = 1 \\text {   时   }} & {\\frac {2 + 8 + 4 + 8}{1 \\times 2 \\times (1 + 4 + 8)} = 1 + \\frac {- 2}{2} + \\frac {A _ {2} + A _ {3}}{1 + 4 + 8}} \\\\ {S = 2 \\text {   时   }} & {\\frac {1 6 + 3 2 + 8 + 8}{2 \\times 3 \\times (4 + 8 + 8)} = \\frac {1}{2} + \\frac {2}{3} + \\frac {2 A _ {2} + A _ {3}}{2 0}} \\\\ {\\Rightarrow A _ {2} = 3} & {A _ {3} = 8} \\end{array} \\right.\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            754,
            107,
            993,
            241
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(5) $X(s) = \\frac{1}{(s + 1)(s^2 + 4)}$",
        "bbox": [
            147,
            258,
            330,
            290
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\begin{array}{r l} {A _ {0}} & {= \\frac {0 + 0 + 0 + 8}{1 \\times 8} = 1} \\\\ {A _ {1}} & {= \\frac {- 2 + 8 - 4 + 8}{- 1 \\times (1 - 4 + 8)} = \\frac {1 0}{- 5} = - 2} \\end{array}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            447,
            243,
            674,
            308
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "$\\uparrow$ 也可以代直",
        "bbox": [
            857,
            241,
            960,
            278
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(6) $X(s) = \\frac{1}{1 + e^{-2s}}$",
